#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Omarchy Bar Editor for Omarchy Shell (GTK4).

A desktop GUI to edit ~/.config/omarchy/shell.json and related config:
  * bar position and transparency
  * active bar host
  * center-anchor widget
  * idle (screensaver / lock) timeouts
  * enabled plugins[] and disabledPlugins[]
  * widget layout for the left / center / right sections
  * add / remove / reorder / move widgets between sections
  * per-widget options (typed where the catalog provides a schema)
  * drag-and-drop reordering
  * global cross-section search
  * undo / redo
  * save / load named layout profiles
  * visual syntax-highlighted save diff
  * shell.toml bar colors, alpha, and sizing (preserved non-destructively)
  * in-app update (git pull in the checkout, then self-restart)

The shell hot-reloads shell.json on save, so changes apply live.
"""

